# S-844 T-964: DotAccess in Call-func position produces Pattern::Constructor with qualified tag.
# [Result.Ok v] → Constructor { tag: "Result.Ok", binding: Some(Variable("v")) }
# Parser accepts this syntax. Runtime tag matching deferred (variant tags currently unqualified).
# The _ arm catches all values until the elaboration pass qualifies variant tags.
[match "x"
    [Result.Ok v]: v
    _:             "other"]
=== out
String("other")
